WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.520
The target blood culture contamination rate should be less than 3 percent.

2
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:13.340
A high contamination rate can lead to false-positive results, which may be mistaken for true bloodstream infections.

3
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:19.320
This results in unnecessary antibiotic use, increased hospital costs, and prolonged hospital stay.

4
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:26.220
Maintaining strict aseptic technique during collection is what keeps contamination rates low and results accurate.

